# =============================================================================
# Embedding Service - Embedding API Smoke Tests
# =============================================================================
# Note: These endpoints are served by the Embedding service (FastAPI),
# not the main .NET API. Update {{baseUrl}} accordingly when running
# against the Embedding service directly.
# =============================================================================

### Embed text – success (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/embeddings/embed
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "text": "wireless bluetooth headphones"
}

### Batch embed – success (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/embeddings/embed/batch
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "texts": ["wireless headphones", "running shoes", "leather wallet"]
}
